1 NAME Svante August /Arrhenius/
2 GIVN Svante August
2 _MARNM Arrhenius
1 NAME Svante August Arrhenius, Nobel Prize in Chemistry 1903
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 ADDR
3 CITY Uppsala
3 STAE Uppsala Län
3 CTRY Sverige
1 BIRT
2 DATE 19 FEB 1859
2 ADDR
3 CITY Vik
3 STAE Uppsala län (C)
3 CTRY Sverige
1 DEAT
2 DATE 2 OCT 1927
2 ADDR
