1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Edvard Jensen (7. desember 1863 på Bodumsløkke). Married 3. december 1882 to Karoline Sophie Berg (b.1864 in Fredrikstad). He was a mate living in Holmegata in 1885 with his wife and his son  Charles Eliam. I 1900 
