1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Notes by Sven Nilsson: <br/>
2 CONT Ole Ulrichsen Olseng bought half of the Famliy Farm Olseng (Old Matrikkel N:o 367)  in 17751220 for 600 Riksdaler with a Deed from his Father.<br/>
2 CONT '''(Riksarkivet, Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Realistisk ordnet avdeling, Idd og Marker fogderi. Deliberasjonsprotokoll, 1803, s.15- 16)''' <br/>
2 CONT His Brother Christian Ulrichsen Olseng became Owner of the other part in the Farm Olseng after an Inventory payment and Deed of 17871009 for a Sum of 790 Riksdaler. <br/>
2 CONT '''(Riksarkivet, Rentekammeret inntil 1814, Realistisk ordnet avdeling, Idd og Marker fogderi. Deliberasjonsprotokoll, 1803, s. 16)''' <br/>
2 CONT The Farm Olseng with an other part of Estate was legally divided between the Brothers 18001120. <br/>
2 CONT '''(Statsarkivet i Oslo, Idd og Marker sorenskriveri, Skifteprotokoll, 1802-1819, s. 230)''' <br/>
2 CONT Ole Ulrichsen Olseng's part of Olseng was in 1805 assessed to 1500 Riksdaler. <br/>
2 CONT '''(Statsarkivet i Oslo, Idd og Marker sorenskriveri, Skifteprotokoll, 1802-1819, s. 232)''' <br/>
2 CONT End of Notes by Sven Nilsson <br/>
2 CONT ------------------
